#. support.faq.contact.q
msgid "How do I contact support?"
msgstr "How do I contact support?"

#. support.faq.contact.a
msgid "Email us at %s. Include a short description, your device platform, and when the problem happened."
msgstr "Email us at %s. Include a short description, your device platform, and when the problem happened."

#. support.faq.contact.action
msgid "Email Support"
msgstr "Email Support"

#. support.faq.crash.q
msgid "What if the game freezes or crashes?"
msgstr "What if the game freezes or crashes?"

#. support.faq.crash.a
msgid "Close and reopen the game first. If it happens again, restart the device and make sure the game is updated. Contact support with the device model, platform version, and what you were doing before the problem."
msgstr "Close and reopen the game first. If it happens again, restart the device and make sure the game is updated. Contact support with the device model, platform version, and what you were doing before the problem."

#. support.faq.sync.q
msgid "How do I sync progress between devices?"
msgstr "How do I sync progress between devices?"

#. support.faq.sync.a
msgid "Use the same signed-in platform account on both devices and allow synchronization to finish before playing. If the progress differs, avoid playing on both devices and contact support."
msgstr "Use the same signed-in platform account on both devices and allow synchronization to finish before playing. If the progress differs, avoid playing on both devices and contact support."

#. support.faq.bad_ad.q
msgid "How do I report a bad ad?"
msgstr "How do I report a bad ad?"

#. support.faq.bad_ad.a
msgid "1. Close the ad if you can do so safely.\n2. Take a screenshot of the ad and any advertiser or app name shown.\n3. Note the approximate time and where the ad appeared in the game.\n4. Describe why the ad seemed offensive, misleading, or fraudulent.\n5. Email these details to %s. Do not include passwords or payment information."
msgstr "1. Close the ad if you can do so safely.\n2. Take a screenshot of the ad and any advertiser or app name shown.\n3. Note the approximate time and where the ad appeared in the game.\n4. Describe why the ad seemed offensive, misleading, or fraudulent.\n5. Email these details to %s. Do not include passwords or payment information."

